	"ButtonGroup",
	"import Preview from \"@components/_docs/Preview.astro\";\nimport PropsTable from \"@components/_docs/PropsTable.astro\";\nimport Button from \"@components/Button.astro\";\nimport ButtonGroup from \"@components/ButtonGroup.astro\";\n\nThe base interactive primitive. Renders as a `<button>` by default, or as an `<a>` when an `href` is provided. Three visual variants and an optional sliding-arrow indicator.\n\n## Preview\n\n<Preview label=\"Variants\">\n  <ButtonGroup>\n    <Button label=\"Primary\" />\n    <Button label=\"Secondary\" variant=\"secondary\" />\n    <Button label=\"Tertiary\" variant=\"tertiary\" />\n  </ButtonGroup>\n</Preview>\n\n<Preview label=\"As link\" align=\"start\">\n  <Button label=\"Read the docs\" href=\"https://docs.astro.build\" target=\"_blank\" />\n</Preview>\n\n<Preview label=\"Without arrow\">\n  <Button label=\"No arrow\" withArrow={false} />\n</Preview>\n\n<Preview label=\"Disabled\">\n  <Button label=\"Disabled\" disabled />\n</Preview>\n\n## Props\n\n<PropsTable props={[\n  { name: \"label\", type: \"string\", default: '\"Learn More\"', description: \"Button text. Falls back to slot content if provided.\" },\n  { name: \"variant\", type: '\"primary\" | \"secondary\" | \"tertiary\"', default: '\"primary\"', description: \"Visual variant. Primary uses the intent color.\" },\n  { name: \"href\", type: \"string\", description: \"When set, renders as an <a> instead of a <button>.\" },\n  { name: \"type\", type: '\"button\" | \"submit\" | \"reset\"', default: '\"button\"', description: \"Button type (ignored when href is set).\" },\n  { name: \"target\", type: \"string\", description: 'Anchor target. Auto-adds rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" when target=\"_blank\".' },\n  { name: \"withArrow\", type: \"boolean\", default: \"true\", description: \"Render the sliding arrow indicator.\" },\n  { name: \"arrowDirection\", type: '\"right\" | \"left\"', default: '\"right\"', description: \"Direction of the arrow + slide animation.\" },\n  { name: \"disabled\", type: \"boolean\", default: \"false\", description: \"Disables the button. Sets aria-disabled when href is provided (since <a> doesn't support disabled).\" },\n  { name: \"class\", type: \"string\", description: \"Extra classes on the rendered element.\" },\n]} />\n\nThe component also forwards arbitrary attributes via `...rest` — so `data-modal-open`, `aria-*`, `onclick`, etc. all pass through to the rendered tag without being declared in the props interface.\n\n## Usage\n\n```astro\n---\nimport Button from \"@components/Button.astro\";\n---\n\n<Button label=\"Submit\" />\n<Button label=\"Cancel\" variant=\"secondary\" />\n<Button label=\"Read more\" href=\"/docs\" />\n<Button label=\"Sign up\" data-modal-open=\"signup\" />   {/* arbitrary attrs forwarded */}\n```\n\n## Tokens\n\n- `primary`: `bg-intent text-fg-on-intent hover:bg-intent-hover`\n- `secondary`: `border border-stroke text-fg hover:bg-panel-muted`\n- `tertiary`: `text-fg hover:bg-panel-muted` (no border)\n- Focus ring: `focus-visible:ring-focus` with `ring-offset-canvas`",
