	"src/components/CardIcon.astro",
	[130],
	"import Preview from \"@components/_docs/Preview.astro\";\nimport PropsTable from \"@components/_docs/PropsTable.astro\";\nimport CardIcon from \"@components/CardIcon.astro\";\nimport { Icon } from \"astro-icon/components\";\n\nA simple icon-driven card. Stat callouts, feature highlights, side-by-side benefit lists. Designed to sit in a grid where adjacent cards share their `border-x`.\n\n## Preview\n\n<Preview label=\"Stat callout\" align=\"start\">\n  <div class=\"w-full max-w-sm\">\n    <CardIcon eyebrow=\"98.3% uptime\" header=\"Proven reliability across sources with proactive monitoring\">\n      <Icon slot=\"icon\" name=\"lucide:activity\" class=\"h-4 w-4 mb-2 text-intent\" />\n      <p slot=\"content\" class=\"text-sm text-fg-muted mt-2\">Backed by SLA and 24/7 status reporting.</p>\n    </CardIcon>\n  </div>\n</Preview>\n\n<Preview label=\"Three in a row\">\n  <div class=\"grid w-full grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3\">\n    <CardIcon eyebrow=\"Fast\" header=\"Sub-second cold start\">\n      <Icon slot=\"icon\" name=\"lucide:zap\" class=\"h-4 w-4 mb-2 text-intent\" />\n    </CardIcon>\n    <CardIcon eyebrow=\"Safe\" header=\"Zero-trust access by default\">\n      <Icon slot=\"icon\" name=\"lucide:shield\" class=\"h-4 w-4 mb-2 text-intent\" />\n    </CardIcon>\n    <CardIcon eyebrow=\"Open\" header=\"Built on open standards\">\n      <Icon slot=\"icon\" name=\"lucide:globe\" class=\"h-4 w-4 mb-2 text-intent\" />\n    </CardIcon>\n  </div>\n</Preview>\n\n## Props\n\n<PropsTable props={[\n  { name: \"eyebrow\", type: \"string\", description: \"Small label text above the heading — typically a category or stat.\" },\n  { name: \"header\", type: \"string\", description: \"Card heading. Renders as <h3> with h5 visual size.\" },\n  { name: \"class\", type: \"string\", default: '\"\"', description: \"Additional classes on the outer div.\" },\n]} />\n\n## Slots\n\n| Slot      | Purpose                                |\n|-----------|----------------------------------------|\n| `icon`    | Icon at the top of the card.           |\n| `content` | Body content below the heading.        |\n\n## Mechanism\n\n- Vertical stack via `flex-col`, `px-6 py-8` padding.\n- `border-x border-stroke` by default — when placed in a grid, neighboring cards share their borders for a single hairline between them.\n\n## Usage\n\n```astro\n---\nimport CardIcon from \"@components/CardIcon.astro\";\nimport { Icon } from \"astro-icon/components\";\n---\n\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-4\">\n  <CardIcon eyebrow=\"98.3% uptime\" header=\"Proven reliability across sources\">\n    <Icon slot=\"icon\" name=\"lucide:activity\" class=\"h-8 w-8 text-intent\" />\n    <p slot=\"content\" class=\"text-sm text-fg-muted\">Additional details here.</p>\n  </CardIcon>\n</div>\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- Designed to sit in a horizontal grid — vertical borders between adjacent cards form a clean rule.\n- Unlike `CardFeatured`, there's no media slot or configurable border prop. Reach for `CardFeatured` when the design needs more flexibility.",
