	[161],
	"import Preview from \"@components/_docs/Preview.astro\";\nimport PropsTable from \"@components/_docs/PropsTable.astro\";\nimport CopyButton from \"@components/CopyButton.astro\";\n\nSmall, focused copy-to-clipboard button. Useful next to inline tokens, share URLs, install commands — and used as the copy affordance inside `CodeBlock`.\n\n## Preview\n\n<Preview label=\"Literal value\" align=\"center\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 py-4\">\n    <code class=\"border border-stroke bg-panel px-2 py-1 text-sm\">npm install astro</code>\n    <CopyButton value=\"npm install astro\" label=\"Copy install command\" class=\"border border-stroke bg-panel px-2 py-1 text-sm\" />\n  </div>\n</Preview>\n\n<Preview label=\"Targeted element\" align=\"center\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 py-4\">\n    <code id=\"copy-share-url\" class=\"border border-stroke bg-panel px-2 py-1 text-sm\">https://example.com/share/abc123</code>\n    <CopyButton target=\"#copy-share-url\" class=\"border border-stroke bg-panel px-2 py-1 text-sm\" />\n  </div>\n</Preview>\n\n## Props\n\n<PropsTable props={[\n  { name: \"value\", type: \"string\", description: \"Literal string to copy. Use this OR `target`, not both.\" },\n  { name: \"target\", type: \"string\", description: \"CSS selector for the element whose `.textContent` is copied.\" },\n  { name: \"label\", type: \"string\", default: '\"Copy\"', description: \"Accessible label and idle button text.\" },\n  { name: \"copiedLabel\", type: \"string\", default: '\"Copied\"', description: \"Feedback text shown briefly after a successful copy.\" },\n  { name: \"feedbackDuration\", type: \"number\", default: \"1500\", description: \"Time in ms the feedback state remains visible.\" },\n  { name: \"class\", type: \"string\", description: \"Additional classes on the button.\" },\n]} />\n\n## Slots\n\n| Slot          | Purpose                                                              |\n|---------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| (default)     | Button text. Defaults to the `label` prop.                            |\n| `icon-idle`   | Custom idle-state icon. Defaults to a clipboard SVG.                 |\n| `icon-copied` | Custom copied-state icon. Defaults to a checkmark SVG.               |\n\n## Accessibility\n\n- Real `<button type=\"button\">` — focusable, keyboard-activatable.\n- `aria-label` set to `label` prop — screen readers announce the action even if the visible text is just an icon.\n- A visually-hidden `aria-live=\"polite\"` region announces \"Copied to clipboard\" / \"Copy failed\" to assistive tech.\n- The state swap (idle ↔ copied) uses a `data-copy-state` attribute that CSS reads — no inline style manipulation, no flash.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Falls back gracefully — if the Clipboard API is denied (insecure context, permissions), the live region announces \"Copy failed\" and the visual state stays idle.\n- `value` takes precedence over `target` if both are set.\n- Reads `target.textContent.trim()` — appropriate for code/URL snippets but be aware of trailing whitespace stripping if you depend on it.",
	"src/content/components/copy-button.mdx",
