	"NavSimple",
	"Media",
	"import PropsTable from \"@components/_docs/PropsTable.astro\";\n\nFull-bleed photo hero. Pass `image` from a CMS photograph or an imported asset. Brand + menu stay in `NavInline` — this component is the media plane only. The homepage itself uses `SectionHomeHero`.\n\n## Props\n\n<PropsTable props={[\n  { name: \"image\", type: \"ImageMetadata | CmsImage\", description: \"Photograph — imported asset or Sanity image.\" },\n  { name: \"alt\", type: \"string\", description: \"Accessible description of the image. Falls back to the CMS alt.\" },\n  { name: \"projectName\", type: \"string\", default: '\"\"', description: \"Lower-right label. Pass an empty string to hide it.\" },\n  { name: \"ariaLabel\", type: \"string\", default: '\"Featured project\"', description: \"Accessible name for the section landmark.\" },\n  { name: \"priority\", type: \"boolean\", default: \"true\", description: \"LCP treatment — eager load + high fetch priority. Set false when something else owns LCP.\" },\n  { name: \"class\", type: \"string\", description: \"Extra classes on the section root.\" },\n]} />\n\n## Usage\n\n```astro\n---\nimport HeroBanner from \"@components/HeroBanner.astro\";\n---\n\n<HeroBanner image={projectCover} projectName=\"Around 1\" alt=\"Night crowd, film grain\" />\n```\n\n## Layout\n\n- Full-bleed on purpose — does not wrap `SectionMain`, so the crop matches the edge-to-edge Figma composition.\n- Place under a layout whose nav can sit over the photograph (e.g. light type on a dark photo). `NavSimple` owns the wordmark + menu; do not duplicate them here.\n\n## Tokens\n\n- Surface fallback: `bg-canvas`\n- Project label: `text-fg/60`, `text-body-xsm`, uppercase (pair with a dark page theme so type stays light on the photo)\n- Spacing: `clamp` insets aligned with the homepage slideshow gutters",
