	[271],
	"import Preview from \"@components/_docs/Preview.astro\";\nimport PropsTable from \"@components/_docs/PropsTable.astro\";\nimport palmUrl from \"../../images/loader-palm.svg?url\";\n\nSite intro loader from the Figma Loader frame: a blank stage with the palm mark centered. Wired into `Layout` by default; dismisses after `window` load (honoring a minimum dwell) and skips on return visits within the same session.\n\n## Preview\n\nStatic composition — the live overlay only runs on a full page load via `Layout`.\n\n<Preview label=\"Centered mark on stage\" align=\"center\">\n  <div class=\"flex min-h-48 w-full items-center justify-center bg-panel text-fg\">\n    <img src={palmUrl} alt=\"\" width=\"54\" height=\"84\" class=\"block size-auto text-fg\" />\n  </div>\n</Preview>\n\n## Props\n\n<PropsTable props={[\n  { name: \"minDuration\", type: \"number\", default: \"800\", description: \"Minimum visible time in ms, even if the document is already ready. Matches --duration-default.\" },\n  { name: \"oncePerSession\", type: \"boolean\", default: \"true\", description: \"Skip on return visits within the same browser session.\" },\n  { name: \"class\", type: \"string\", description: \"Extra classes on the overlay root.\" },\n]} />\n\n## Layout\n\nPass `skipLoader` on `Layout` to opt a page out (useful for docs or error pages). The overlay is otherwise included on every page.\n\n## Behavior\n\n- Covers the viewport with `bg-panel` / `text-fg` so themes invert correctly.\n- Palm mark breathes gently while waiting; reduced-motion users get a static mark and an immediate exit.\n- Locks document scroll while visible; restores on dismiss.\n- `role=\"status\"` + visually hidden “Loading”; `inert` while covering the page.\n- Without JS, a `<noscript>` rule hides the overlay so the page stays usable.",
