	"import Preview from \"@components/_docs/Preview.astro\";\nimport PropsTable from \"@components/_docs/PropsTable.astro\";\nimport Logo from \"@components/Logo.astro\";\n\nThe \"Miscreants\" SVG wordmark. All paths use `fill=\"currentColor\"`, so color is driven by the parent's `text-*` utility.\n\n## Preview\n\n<Preview label=\"Default\">\n  <Logo class=\"h-5 w-auto text-fg\" />\n</Preview>\n\n<Preview label=\"Larger, muted\">\n  <Logo class=\"h-8 w-auto text-fg-muted\" />\n</Preview>\n\n<Preview label=\"Inverted on dark surface\" class=\"bg-fg\">\n  <Logo class=\"h-6 w-auto text-canvas\" />\n</Preview>\n\n## Props\n\n<PropsTable props={[\n  { name: \"class\", type: \"string\", default: '\"\"', description: \"Classes applied to the <svg> element. Use h-* + w-auto for sizing, text-* for color.\" },\n]} />\n\n## Mechanism\n\n- The SVG sets `width=\"100%\"` with a fixed `viewBox=\"0 0 370 57\"`, so it stretches to fill the parent's width while preserving aspect ratio.\n- Every path uses `fill=\"currentColor\"` — the wordmark inherits its color from the nearest ancestor with a `color` value (i.e. any Tailwind `text-*` utility).\n- `aria-label=\"Miscreants\"` and `role=\"img\"` make it announce as a single image to assistive tech.\n\n## Usage\n\n```astro\n---\nimport Logo from \"@components/Logo.astro\";\n---\n\n<Logo class=\"h-5 w-auto\" />\n\n<div class=\"text-canvas\">\n  <Logo class=\"h-8 w-auto\" />\n</div>\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- Use `h-*` together with `w-auto` to size the logo. Without `w-auto`, the SVG's `width=\"100%\"` will fill the parent's width.\n- The registered-trademark mark is part of the path data — not a separate text run.",
