	"import Preview from \"@components/_docs/Preview.astro\";\nimport PropsTable from \"@components/_docs/PropsTable.astro\";\nimport LogoMenu from \"@components/LogoMenu.astro\";\n\nWraps the site `Logo` in a normal home link and overrides the browser's right-click menu with a small custom one. The first item copies the inline `<svg>` markup to the clipboard; remaining items are arbitrary links (brand assets, press kit, guidelines, Figma file, etc.). Wired into `NavMorph` by default — right-click the wordmark in the header to see it.\n\n## Preview\n\n<Preview label=\"Right-click the wordmark\" align=\"start\">\n  <LogoMenu logoClass=\"h-5 w-auto\" />\n</Preview>\n\n<Preview label=\"Custom items\" align=\"start\">\n  <LogoMenu\n    logoClass=\"h-5 w-auto\"\n    items={[\n      { type: \"action\", label: \"Copy logo as SVG\", action: \"copy-svg\" },\n      { type: \"link\", label: \"Press kit\", href: \"/press/\" },\n      { type: \"link\", label: \"Figma file\", href: \"https://figma.com/file/abc\", target: \"_blank\" },\n      { type: \"link\", label: \"Brand guidelines\", href: \"/brand/guidelines/\" },\n    ]}\n  />\n</Preview>\n\n## Props\n\n<PropsTable props={[\n  { name: \"href\", type: \"string\", default: '\"/\"', description: \"Destination of the logo home link (left-click).\" },\n  { name: \"ariaLabel\", type: \"string\", default: '\"Home\"', description: \"Accessible label for the trigger anchor and prefix on the menu's aria-label.\" },\n  { name: \"items\", type: \"Item[]\", default: \"3-item default\", description: \"Menu entries. See item shape below. Defaults to: Copy logo as SVG / Download logo pack / View brand guidelines.\" },\n  { name: \"class\", type: \"string\", description: \"Extra classes on the wrapping <div> (e.g. layout padding).\" },\n  { name: \"logoClass\", type: \"string\", default: '\"h-5 w-auto\"', description: \"Classes forwarded to the inner <Logo /> SVG.\" },\n]} />\n\n### Item shape\n\n```ts\ntype Item =\n  | { type: \"action\"; label: string; action: \"copy-svg\" }\n  | { type?: \"link\"; label: string; href: string; target?: string };\n```\n\n- `action` items render as `<button>` and run the named action. Currently only `\"copy-svg\"` is supported — extend the `panel.click` handler in the component script to add more.\n- `link` items render as `<a>`. When `target=\"_blank\"`, `rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"` is added automatically.\n\n## Mechanism\n\n### Trigger\n\n- The whole logo is a single `<a href={href}>` so left-click navigates home.\n- A `contextmenu` listener on that anchor calls `preventDefault()` and toggles the panel.\n\n### Panel\n\n- `role=\"menu\"` with `role=\"menuitem\"` children.\n- Positioned absolutely (`top-full mt-2 left-0`); only visible while not `hidden`.\n- Closes on: outside click, `Escape`, `Tab`, or after an item is chosen.\n- Arrow Up/Down/Home/End move focus through items.\n- `aria-expanded` on the trigger reflects panel state.\n\n### Copy SVG\n\n- Clones the inline `<svg>`, ensures `xmlns` is present, serializes via `XMLSerializer`.\n- Writes to clipboard via `navigator.clipboard.writeText`; falls back to a hidden `<textarea>` + `document.execCommand(\"copy\")` if the modern API rejects (e.g. insecure context).\n- On success, fires the toast with \"Logo copied to clipboard\"; on failure, \"Copy failed\".\n\n### Toast\n\n- Single `role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"` element fixed at `bottom-4 right-4`.\n- Fades + slides in (180 ms), holds 1.8 s, fades out (200 ms).\n- Honours `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` (no transitions).\n- Lives inside the component instance, so multiple `LogoMenu` mounts each get their own toast.\n\n## Usage\n\n```astro\n---\nimport LogoMenu from \"@components/LogoMenu.astro\";\n---\n\n{/* Default — 3 items, links to /brand/ and /brand/guidelines/ */}\n<LogoMenu />\n\n{/* Custom items */}\n<LogoMenu\n  href=\"/\"\n  items={[\n    { type: \"action\", label: \"Copy logo as SVG\", action: \"copy-svg\" },\n    { type: \"link\", label: \"Press kit\", href: \"/press/\" },\n    { type: \"link\", label: \"Figma file\", href: \"https://figma.com/file/abc\", target: \"_blank\" },\n  ]}\n/>\n```\n\n## Extending\n\nTo add a new action (e.g. \"Copy logo as PNG\"):\n\n1. Extend the `ActionItem` union with the new action name.\n2. Render it as a `<button data-action=\"…\">`.\n3. Branch on the action in the `panel.click` handler inside the script and call your handler.\n4. Resolve to `true` on success so the toast confirms.\n\n## Notes\n\n- The script is module-scoped and queries `[data-logo-menu]` once on load. If you mount one dynamically, call `init()` manually.\n- Right-click on touch devices doesn't apply — left-click still navigates home; the menu is desktop-only by intent. A long-press handler can be added if needed.",
