	"src/components/ProjectView.astro",
	[494],
	"import Preview from \"@components/_docs/Preview.astro\";\nimport PropsTable from \"@components/_docs/PropsTable.astro\";\nimport ProjectView from \"@components/ProjectView.astro\";\n\nRadiogroup used on the project rail, directly under the title. Selecting an option writes `data-view` on the closest `[data-project]` ancestor so the gallery can switch between a vertical column and the Work-index 2-up grid. The last choice is stored under `ati-project-view`. Selected label is bold; idle labels sit muted.\n\n## Preview\n\n<Preview label=\"Default — Single Column selected\" align=\"start\">\n  <div data-project data-view=\"column\" class=\"min-h-24\">\n    <ProjectView />\n  </div>\n</Preview>\n\n## Props\n\n<PropsTable props={[\n  { name: \"label\", type: \"string\", default: '\"Photograph layout\"', description: \"Accessible name on the radiogroup.\" },\n  { name: \"value\", type: '\"column\" | \"grid\"', default: '\"column\"', description: \"SSR default. The client overrides this from localStorage.\" },\n  { name: \"class\", type: \"string\", description: \"Additional classes on the radiogroup wrapper.\" },\n]} />\n\n## Mechanism\n\n- ARIA radio pattern: `role=\"radiogroup\"` on the wrapper, `role=\"radio\"` + `aria-checked` on each button, roving `tabindex`.\n- Arrow keys, Home, and End move the selection. Click and keyboard both persist the choice.\n- Dispatches a bubbling `project:view` event with `{ view }` so a parent can react without reading the DOM.\n- Labels are the same size (`text-body-md`); the selected label uses `text-fg` and bold, idle labels use `text-fg-muted`.\n\n## Usage\n\n```astro\n---\nimport ProjectView from \"@components/ProjectView.astro\";\n---\n\n<section data-project data-view=\"column\">\n  <ProjectView />\n</section>\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- Without a `[data-project]` ancestor the radios still update visually; only the gallery layout contract is skipped.\n- The product hides this control below the `lg` breakpoint; the gallery stays a single column there regardless of `data-view`.",
	"src/content/components/project-view.mdx",
