	"import PropsTable from \"@components/_docs/PropsTable.astro\";\n\nFigma Home (`222:21`): a white canvas and one photograph, centered. The shot is chosen at random from the homepage's Sanity hero photographs (up to 5) whenever the page loads. Brand + menu stay in `NavInline`.\n\n## Props\n\n<PropsTable props={[\n  { name: \"images\", type: \"CmsImage[]\", required: true, description: \"Hero photographs from Sanity. One is shown at random.\" },\n  { name: \"class\", type: \"string\", description: \"Extra classes on the section root.\" },\n]} />\n\n## Layout\n\n- Full-viewport on purpose — does not wrap `SectionMain`, so the crop matches the edge-to-edge Figma composition.\n- Images are authored on the Home document in Studio (`Hero photographs`).\n- Without JavaScript the first photograph is shown.",
